<td align="left" width="750">               
<p>
        <b><font size="+1" color="#001ba5">Research Interests</font></b> </p>
          <ul>
          <li> Scientific computation and numerical analysis.</li>
          <li> Exact boundary controllability problems for the wave equation.</li>
          <li> Parallel algorithms and high-performance computing.</li>
          <li> Image processing.</li>
          </ul> 
</tr>
</tbody></table></center>
 <hr width="750">        
         
<center><table cellpadding="4" width="750"> 
</tbody></tr>
<td align="left" width="750">  
<p>
         <b><font size="+1" color="#001ba5">Computing Skills</font></b> </p>
         <ul>
         <li> Operating Systems:&nbsp; <i>UNIX/Linux, Windows.</i></li>
         <li> Programming Languages:&nbsp; <i>Fortran77/90, C/C++, Java, 
              Matlab.</i></li>
         <li> Parallel Environments:&nbsp; <i>MPI, PVM, OpenMP.</i></li>
         </ul>
</tr>
</tbody></table></center>
 
