<center><table cellpadding="4" width="750"> 
</tbody></tr>
   <td align="left" width="750">              
<p>
        <b><font size="+1" color="#001ba5">Publications</font></b> 
</p>
       <ul>      
       <li> ``Parallel implementation of a pressure-correction projection method 
            for the unsteady incompressible Navier-Stokes equations'',
            <i>Math. Numer. Sin</i>., Vol. <b>20</b>, pp. 325-336, 1998; 
            with L.B. Zhang. 
            <a href="../my_papers/sci_pinse.pdf" "target="frame2"> (pdf file)</a> </li>

       <li> ``Probabilistic methods for centroidal Voronoi tessellations and their
             parallel implementations'', <i>Parallel Computing</i>,
             Vol. <b>28</b>, pp. 1477-1500, 2002; with Q. Du and M. Gunzburger.
             <a href="../my_papers/sci_pcvt.pdf" "target="frame2"> (pdf file)</a> </li>   

       <li> ``Meshfree, probabilistic determination of point
            sets and support regions for meshless computing'', 
            <i>Comput. Meths. Appl. Mech. Engrg.</i>, Vol. <b>191</b>, pp. 
            1349-1366, 2002; with Q. Du and M. Gunzburger.    
            <a href="../my_papers/sci_pdmlc.pdf" "target="frame2"> (pdf file)</a> </li>

       <li> ``A numerical method for controllability problems 
            for the wave equation'', <i> Hyperbolic Problems: Theory, Numerics, 
            Applications</i>,
            <!--<b>Proceedings of the Ninth International Conference on Hyperbolic Problems</b>,-->
            Pasadena, March, pp. 557-568, 2002; with M. Gunzburger and L.S. Hou.
            <a href="../my_papers/sci_wave.pdf" "target="frame2"> (pdf file)</a> </li>

       <li> ``Comparing the performance of MPICH with Cray's
             MPI and with SGI's MPI'', <i>Concurrency Computat.:
             Pract. and Exper.</i>, Vol. <b>15</b>, pp. 779-802, 2003;
             with G. Luecke and M. Kraeva.
             <a href="../my_papers/sci_cmpi.pdf" "target="frame2"> (pdf file)</a> </li>

       <li> ``Constrained centroidal Voronoi tessellations for surfaces'', 
             <i>SIAM J. Sci. Comput.</i>, Vol. <b>24</b>, pp. 1488-1506, 2003; 
             with Q. Du and M. Gunzburger. 
             <a href="../my_papers/sci_ccvt.pdf" "target="frame2"> (pdf file)</a> </li>

       <li> ``Approximation of exact boundary controllability problems for the 
            1-D wave equation by optimization based methods'', <i>Contemporary 
            Mathematics</i>, Vol. <b>330</b>, pp. 133-153, 2003; with 
            M. Gunzburger and L.S. Hou.
            <a href="../my_papers/sci_wave1d.pdf" "target="frame2"> (pdf file)</a> </li>

       <li> ``Voronoi-based finite volume methods, optimal Voronoi meshes, 
            and PDEs on the sphere'', <i>Comput. Meths. Appl. Mech.    
            Engrg.</i>, Vol. <b>192</b>, pp. 3933-3957, 2003; with Q.
            Du and  M.  Gunzburger. 
            <a href="../my_papers/sci_fvmspde.pdf" "target="frame2"> (pdf file)</a> </li>

       <li> ``Cortical surface flattening using least square conformal
            mapping with minimal metric distortion'', <i>Proceedings       
            of ISBI'04</i>, pp. 77-80, Arlington,  April, 2004; with D. 
	    Rottenberg  and <i>et al..</i>
            <a href="../my_papers/sci_csflscm.pdf" "target="frame2"> (pdf file)</a> </li>

       <li> ``Numerical simulations of the quantized vortices in a thin
            superconducting hollow sphere'', <i>J. Comput.
            Physics</i>, Vol. <b>201</b>, pp. 511-530, 2004; with Q. Du. 
            <a href="../my_papers/sci_agls.pdf" "target="frame2"> (pdf file)</a> </li>

        <li> ``Approximations of a Ginzburg-Landau model for superconducting
              hollow spheres based on spherical centroidal Voronoi 
              tessellations'', <i>Math. Comp.</i>, Vol. <b>74</b>, pp. 1257-1280, 
              2005; with Q. Du.
              <a href="../my_papers/sci_nsgls.pdf" "target="frame2"> (pdf file)</a> </li>

       <li> ``Finite volume methods on spheres and spherical centroidal
             Voronoi meshes'', <i>SIAM J. Numer. Anal.</i>, Vol. <b>43</b>, pp. 
             1673-1692, 2005; with Q. Du. 
             <a href="../my_papers/sci_fvmsscvt.pdf" "target="frame2"> (pdf file)</a> </li>

        <li> ``Quantitative evaluation of three cortical surface flattening
             methods'', <i>Neuroimage</i>, Vol. <b>28</b>, pp. 869-880, 2005; with D.
             Rottenberg and <i>et al..</i> 
             <a href="../my_papers/sci_qecsf.pdf" "target="frame2"> (pdf file)</a> </li>
       
       <li> ``Convergence of the Lloyd algorithm for computing centroidal Voronoi 
            tessellations'', <i>SIAM J. Numer. Anal.</i>,  Vol. <b>44</b>, pp.
            102-119, 2006; with Qiang Du and Maria Emelianenko. 
            <a href="../my_papers/sci_lloyd.pdf" "target="frame2"> (pdf file)</a> </li>

       <li> ``Centroidal Voronoi tessellation algorithms for image compression,
             segmentation, and multichannel restoration'', <i>J. Math.
             Imaging and Vision</i>,  Vol. <b>24</b>, pp.
             177-194, 2006; with Q. Du, M. Gunzburger and X. Wang.
             <a href="../my_papers/sci_cvtseg.pdf" "target="frame2"> (pdf file)</a> </li>
       
       <li> ``A numerical method for exact boundary controllability
            problems for the 2-D wave equation'', <i>Comput. Math. Appl.</i>, Vol. 
            <b>51</b>, pp. 721-750, 2006; with M. Gunzburger and L.S. Hou.
            <a href="../my_papers/sci_wave2d.pdf" "target="frame2"> (pdf file)</a> </li>
       
       <li> ``Conforming centroidal Voronoi Delaunay triangulation for
            quality mesh generation'', <i>Int. J. Numer. Anal. Model.</i>, to appear. 
            <a href="../my_papers/meshgen.pdf" "target="frame2"> (pdf file)</a></li>
       
       <li> ``Adaptive finite element methods for elliptic PDEs based on conforming
            centroidal Voronoi Delaunay triangulations'', <i>SIAM J. Sci. Comput.</i>,
            to appear; with M. Gunzburger and W.D. Zhao. 
            <a href="../my_papers/afemccvdt.pdf" "target="frame2"> (pdf file)</a></li>
       
       <li> ``Error estimates for a finite volume methods on general surfaces'',
             submitted; with Qiang Du. 
             <a href="../my_papers/fvmgs.pdf" "target="frame2"> (pdf file)</a> </li>    
                            
       <li> ``Convergence analysis of a splitting method for stochastic differential equations'', 
            submitted; with W.D. Zhao and Li Tian. 
            <a href="../my_papers/Num4SDEs.pdf" "target="frame2"> (pdf file)</a></li> 

       <li> ``Constrained CVT meshes and a comparison of triangular mesh generators'', 
             submitted, 2006; with H. Nguyen, J. Burkardt, M. Gunzburger and Yuki Saka.</li>
             <a href="../my_papers/compccvt.pdf" "target="frame2"> (pdf file)</a> 

       <li> ``Adaptive control volume vethods for convection-diffusion 
              equations with mesh optimization'', in preparation; with W.D. Zhao. </li>

       <li> ``An adaptive strategy for convection dominated problems with anisotropic 
             mesh refinement'',
             in preparation; with H. Nguyen, J. Burkardt and M. Gunzburger.</li>
          
    </ul>           
</tr>
